@ 1:1  |agentflow-beta LR
  1:1-1:15 "agentflow-beta"
  | **`agentflow-beta`**
  |
  | `agentflow-beta LR`. The direction is optional (default `TB`).
@ 1:17  agentflow-beta L|R
  1:16-1:18 "LR"
  | **`LR`** direction: left to right
@ 2:7  conn|ector c
  2:3-2:12 "connector"
  | **`connector`**
  |
  | `connector id`, `connector id[title]`, either with metadata `@{ … }`.
@ 3:5  fl|ow f
  3:3-3:7 "flow"
  | **`flow`**
  |
  | `flow id`, `flow id[title]`, either with metadata `@{ … }`, or an anonymous `flow`; then statements, then `end`.
@ 4:8  dir|ection TB
  4:5-4:17 "direction TB"
  | **`direction TB`**
  |
  | `direction LR` inside a flow: the direction of its layout.
@ 6:4  e|nd
  6:3-6:6 "end"
  | **`end`**
  |
  | `flow id`, `flow id[title]`, either with metadata `@{ … }`, or an anonymous `flow`; then statements, then `end`.
@ 7:6  glo|bal
  7:3-7:9 "global"
  | **`global`**
  |
  | `global` … `end`: the nodes written in it belong to no flow.
@ 10:6  sty|le a fill:#f00
  10:3-10:8 "style"
  | **`style`**
  |
  | `style id fill:#f9f,stroke:#333`: styles one node or flow.
@ 11:8  class|Def k fill:#0f0
  11:3-11:11 "classDef"
  | **`classDef`**
  |
  | `classDef name fill:#f9f,color:#000`: defines a class of styles; `classDef default …` styles every node without a class.
@ 12:6  acc|Title: Title
  12:3-12:12 "accTitle:"
  | **`accTitle:`**
  |
  | `accTitle: …`: the accessible title of the diagram.
